          "code": "PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE",
          "id": "1770000001011",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "description": "Authors a concise business summary and table title from prepared Billing records",
            "errorNodeId": "1779832851336",
            "name": "Author Billing Summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770000001013"
          },
          "code": "AUTHOR_BILLING_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1770000001012",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770000001012_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are the Billing Inquiry response author for Oracle Receivables. Return JSON only.\n\nUse only the provided data. Do not invent amounts, statuses, dates, invoice numbers, credit memos, or customer names. If records are empty, use the no_data_message and do not imply data exists. If clarification_message is present, ask that clarification directly.\n\nInputs:\n- semantic_user_input: {{$context.$nodes.RESOLVE_BILLING_SEMANTIC_CONTEXT.$output.semanticRewrite}}\n- raw_user_input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- intent: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_BILLING_EXTRACT.$output.result.intent}}\n- shape_key: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_BILLING_EXTRACT.$output.result.shapeKey}}\n- summary_instruction: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_BILLING_EXTRACT.$output.result.summaryInstruction}}\n- clarification_message: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_BILLING_EXTRACT.$output.result.missingMessage}}\n- no_data_message: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result.noDataMessage}}\n- table_columns: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result.tableColumns}}\n- rows: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result.rows}}\n- full_rows: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result.fullRows}}\n- metrics: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result.metrics}}\n- totals_text: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result.totalsText}}\n- no_data_category: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result.noDataCategory}}\n\nWrite an intuitive business summary in one or two sentences. Treat returned table rows as business records; in narrative summary and recommendation text, say records instead of rows. Use metrics and totals_text when present; do not recompute totals in prose if deterministic totals are supplied separately. Format narrative monetary values as compact ISO-currency amounts such as USD 1.25K, EUR 49.2M, or USD 312K. Never use currency symbols such as $, €, or £. Never return raw {amount:...,currency:...} tokens in narrative text. For mixed currencies, keep totals split by currency and never add different currencies together. Prefer concrete facts: invoice number, customer, dates, payment/remaining amount, delivery method, line count/total, tax rate, taxable amount, exemption certificate, tax-exempt reason, product or transaction classification, exchange rate, dispute amount, dispute reason, dispute status, credit memo, adjustment status. For tax-charge requests, surface recorded tax and exemption fields only; do not infer tax-determination root cause. For document-copy requests, say the invoice was located and mention customerTransactionId if present; do not claim a file was downloaded. Choose a short, sensible table title. Tables render exact monetary values separately, so the narrative should stay compact.\n\nWrite one data-grounded recommendation for what the user should do next. Base it only on the returned records, intent, clarification_message, and no_data_message. If records are empty or clarification is needed, recommend the next lookup or clarification step instead of inventing a business action.\n\nFor salesOrderFulfillment fallback results, state that the table shows Order Management fulfillment lines, not Receivables invoice records. Mention order status, line status, ordered/fulfilled quantity, bill-to customer, ship-to party, item, and billing setup flag when available.\n\nReturn this JSON shape:\n{\"title\":\"short table title\",\"summary\":\"one or two grounded sentences\",\"recommendation\":\"one grounded recommendation or next step\"}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"title\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"recommendation\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"title\",\n    \"summary\",\n    \"recommendation\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Resolve Data Refs",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "/*\n  Summary:\n  - Read the authored display plan.\n  - For every component with dataRef, resolve the referenced context path.\n  - Append pathToItems to that base path when provided.\n  - Replace dataRef/pathToItems with resolved data.\n  - For table components, also add columnOrder using the first resolved row's key order.\n  - Throw INVALID_REQUEST when dataRef is missing, unresolved, or resolves to empty data.\n  - Return the full display plan back.\n*/\n\nconst displayPlanRaw = $context.$nodes.COMPILE_DISPLAY_PLAN.$output.result;\n\nfunction parseIfString(value) {\n  let parsed = value;\n\n  while (typeof parsed === \"string\") {\n    parsed = JSON.parse(parsed);\n  }\n\n  return parsed;\n}\n\nfunction clone(value) {\n  return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value));\n}\n\nfunction throwInvalidRequest(message, details) {\n  const error = new Error(\"[INVALID_REQUEST] \" + message);\n  error.errorType = \"INVALID_REQUEST\";\n  error.details = details || {};\n  throw error;\n}\n\n// Resolve simple context paths like:\nfunction resolveContextPath(pathExpression) {\n  const path = String(pathExpression || \"\").trim();\n\n  if (!path) {\n    throwInvalidRequest(\"dataRef is empty.\");\n  }\n\n  if (!path.startsWith(\"$context.\")) {\n    throwInvalidRequest(\n      \"dataRef must start with '$context.'. Received: \" + path,\n      { dataRef: path }\n    );\n  }\n\n  const segments = path.split(\".\").filter(Boolean);\n  let current = { $context };\n\n  for (const segment of segments) {\n    if (typeof current === \"undefined\" || current === null) {\n      throwInvalidRequest(\n        \"Unable to resolve dataRef path. Missing segment: \" + segment,\n        { dataRef: path, missingSegment: segment }\n      );\n    }\n\n    current = current[segment];\n  }\n\n  return current;\n}\n\n// pathToItems is appended after dataRef.\nfunction buildResolvedPath(dataRef, pathToItems) {\n  const basePath = String(dataRef || \"\").trim();\n  const suffix = String(pathToItems || \"\").trim();\n\n  if (!suffix) {\n    return basePath;\n  }\n\n  const normalizedSuffix = suffix.replace(/^\\.+/, \"\");\n  return basePath + \".\" + normalizedSuffix;\n}\n\nfunction isEmptyResolvedData(value) {\n  if (typeof value === \"undefined\" || value === null) {\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  if (typeof value === \"string\") {\n    return value.trim().length === 0;\n  }\n\n  if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return value.length === 0;\n  }\n\n  if (typeof value === \"object\") {\n    return Object.keys(value).length === 0;\n  }\n\n  return false;\n}\n\nfunction validateResolvedData(component, resolvedData, resolvedPath) {\n  if (isEmptyResolvedData(resolvedData)) {\n    throwInvalidRequest(\n      \"Resolved data is empty for component: \" + component.id,\n      {\n        componentId: component.id,\n        componentType: component.type,\n        resolvedPath\n      }\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// For table components, preserve the source key order from the first row.\nfunction buildColumnOrderFromResolvedData(resolvedData) {\n  if (!Array.isArray(resolvedData) || resolvedData.length === 0) {\n    return [];\n  }\n\n  const firstRow = resolvedData[0];\n\n  if (!firstRow || typeof firstRow !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(firstRow)) {\n    return [];\n  }\n\n  return Object.keys(firstRow);\n}\n\nfunction resolveComponentData(component) {\n  if (!component.dataRef) {\n    return component;\n  }\n\n  const resolvedPath = buildResolvedPath(component.dataRef, component.pathToItems);\n  let resolvedData = resolveContextPath(resolvedPath);\n  resolvedData = parseIfString(resolvedData);\n\n  validateResolvedData(component, resolvedData, resolvedPath);\n\n  component.data = clone(resolvedData);\n\n  if (component.type === \"table\") {\n    component.columnOrder = buildColumnOrderFromResolvedData(resolvedData);\n  }\n\n  delete component.dataRef;\n  delete component.pathToItems;\n\n  return component;\n}\n\nfunction resolveDisplayPlanData(plan) {\n  if (!plan || typeof plan !== \"object\") {\n    throw new Error(\"Display plan is missing or invalid.\");\n  }\n\n  if (!Array.isArray(plan.components)) {\n    throw new Error(\"Display plan components must be an array.\");\n  }\n\n  const resolvedPlan = clone(plan);\n\n  resolvedPlan.components = resolvedPlan.components.map((component) =>\n    resolveComponentData(component)\n  );\n\n  return resolvedPlan;\n}\n\nconst displayPlan = parseIfString(displayPlanRaw);\nreturn resolveDisplayPlanData(displayPlan);"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777274068828"
          },
          "code": "RESOLVE_DATA_REFS",
          "id": "1777273586554",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Uses authored summary when useful and builds deterministic fallback summaries for key billing intents",
            "errorNodeId": "1779832851336",
            "name": "Normalize Billing Summary",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var P=$context.$nodes.BUILD_BILLING_EXTRACT.$output.result||{},T=$context.$nodes.PREPARE_BILLING_TABLE.$output.result||{},S=$context.$nodes.AUTHOR_BILLING_SUMMARY.$output||{};if(typeof S==='string')try{S=JSON.parse(S)}catch(e){S={}}\nvar R=(T.rows||[])[0]||{},F=(T.fullRows||[])[0]||{},ttl='Billing Inquiry Results',ans='',rec='',iv=R.invoiceNumber||R.transactionNumber||R.customerTransactionTransactionNumber||F.invoiceNumber||F.transactionNumber||F.customerTransactionTransactionNumber||(P.normalizedContext&&P.normalizedContext.invoiceNumber)||'';\nvar H={n(v){if(v==null||v==='')return null;if(typeof v==='object'&&v.amount!=null)v=v.amount;var x=Number(String(v).replace(/,/g,'').replace(/[^0-9.\\-]/g,''));return Number.isFinite(x)?x:null},round(v,p){v=Number(v);if(!Number.isFinite(v))return null;p=p==null?2:p;var m=Math.pow(10,p);return Math.round((v+Number.EPSILON)*m)/m},exact(c,x){var v=this.round(x,2);if(v==null||!c||c==='ANY'||c==='XXX')return '';return c+' '+v.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})},compact(c,x,suf){var v=Number(x);if(!Number.isFinite(v)||!c||c==='ANY'||c==='XXX')return '';if(suf){var d0=Math.abs(v)>=100?0:(Math.abs(v)>=10?1:2),rv=this.round(v,d0);return c+' '+rv.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:0,maximumFractionDigits:d0})+suf}var a=Math.abs(v),y=v,s='';if(a>=1000000000){y=v/1000000000;s='B'}else if(a>=1000000){y=v/1000000;s='M'}else if(a>=1000){y=v/1000;s='K'}else return this.exact(c,v);var d=Math.abs(y)>=100?0:(Math.abs(y)>=10?1:2),ry=this.round(y,d);return c+' '+ry.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:0,maximumFractionDigits:d})+s},clean(s,compact){var x=String(s||''),re=/\\{\\s*amount\\s*:\\s*([^,{}]+?)\\s*,\\s*currency\\s*:\\s*([A-Z]{3})\\s*\\}/g,m,o='',l=0;while((m=re.exec(x))){var c=m[2],n=this.n(m[1]);o+=x.slice(l,m.index)+((c==='ANY'||c==='XXX'||n==null)?'':(compact?this.compact(c,n):this.exact(c,n)));l=re.lastIndex}o+=x.slice(l);o=o.replace(/[$€£]/g,'').